<cell id="cell-0"><cell_type>markdown</cell_type># T5 Fine-tuning for Accessibility-Focused Text Simplification

Fine-tunes **T5-small** specifically for neurodivergent accessibility needs (dyslexia, ADHD, autism).

### Dataset Strategy
Combines multiple simplification datasets with **accessibility weighting** to prioritize:
- Shorter sentences (< 15 words)
- High-frequency vocabulary (easier word recognition)
- Concrete words (lower Age of Acquisition scores)
- Simpler syntactic structures

**Benefits:**
- Better reading comprehension for dyslexic users
- Reduced cognitive load for ADHD users
- More literal, concrete phrasing for autistic users

**Before running:** Go to `Runtime > Change runtime type > T4 GPU`

**Expected training time:** 2-3 hours for 8-10 epochs

**Checkpoint:** Auto-saves best model every 1000 steps</cell id="cell-0">

